      "hindiTransliteration": "अनंगी अनामे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74413",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0059",
      "lineIndex": 59,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਮਸਤੀ ਸਰੂਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "samasatee saroope ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O All-Form Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸਭ ਦੇ ਸਰੂਪ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "समसती सरूपे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74414",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0060",
      "lineIndex": 60,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪ੍ਰਭੰਗੀ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਥੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "prabha(n)gee pramaathe ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Destroyer Lord!  Salutation to Thee O Omnipotent Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੁਖਦਾਇਕਾ ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "प्रभंगी प्रमाथे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74415",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0061",
      "lineIndex": 61,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਮਸਤੀ ਬਿਭੂਤੇ ॥੪੯॥",
      "transliteration": "samasatee bibhoote ||49||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Greatest to All Lord  49",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਸਾਰੀ ਸਾਮਗ੍ਰੀ ਦੇ ਭੰਡਾਰ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੪੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "समसती बिभूते ॥४९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74416",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0062",
      "lineIndex": 62,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਲੰਕੰ ਬਿਨਾ ਨੇਕਲੰਕੀ ਸਰੂਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kala(n)ka(n) binaa nekala(n)kee saroope ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Supreme Sovereign Lord! Salutation to Thee O Most Beautiful Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਕਲੰਕ-ਰਹਿਤ, ਨਿਸ਼ਕਲੰਕ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੇ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कलंकं बिना नेकलंकी सरूपे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74417",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0063",
      "lineIndex": 63,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਰਾਜ ਰਾਜੇਸ੍ਵਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਰੂਪੇ ॥੫੦॥",
      "transliteration": "namo raaj raajesavaira(n) param roope ||50||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Supreme Sovereign Lord!  Salutation to Thee Most Beautiful Lord! 50",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਾਜਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਰਾਜੇ ਅਤੇ ਮਹਾਨ ਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੫੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो राज राजेस्वरं परम रूपे ॥५०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74418",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0064",
      "lineIndex": 64,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਜੋਗ ਜੋਗੇਸ੍ਵਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਸਿੱਧੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo jog jogesavaira(n) param si'dhe ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Supreme Yogi Lord!  Salutation to Thee O Supreme Adept Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਜੋਗੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਜੋਗੀ, ਸ੍ਰੇਸ਼ਠ ਸਿੱਧ ਸਰੂਪ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो जोग जोगेस्वरं परम सिद्धे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74419",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0065",
      "lineIndex": 65,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਰਾਜ ਰਾਜੇਸ੍ਵਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਬ੍ਰਿਧੇ ॥੫੧॥",
      "transliteration": "namo raaj raajesavaira(n) param biradhe ||51||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Supreme Emperor Lord!  Salutation to Thee O Supreme Entity Lord! 51",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਰਾਜਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਰਾਜੇ, ਮਹਾਨ ਵਡਿਆਈ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੫੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो राज राजेस्वरं परम बृधे ॥५१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74420",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0066",
      "lineIndex": 66,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਸਸਤ੍ਰ ਪਾਣੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo sasatr paane ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Weapon-wielder Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਹੱਥ ਵਿਚ ਸ਼ਸਤ੍ਰ ਧਾਰਨ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो ससत्र पाणे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74421",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0067",
      "lineIndex": 67,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਮਾਣੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo asatr maane ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Weapon-user Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਅਸਤ੍ਰ ਵਰਤਣ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो असत्र माणे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74422",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0068",
      "lineIndex": 68,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਪਰਮ ਗਿਆਤਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo param giaataa ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Supreme Knower Lord!  Salutation to Thee O Illusionless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਭ ਕੁਝ ਜਾਣਨ ਵਾਲੇ (ਸਰਵੱਗ)! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो परम गिआता ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74423",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0069",
      "lineIndex": 69,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਲੋਕ ਮਾਤਾ ॥੫੨॥",
      "transliteration": "namo lok maataa ||52||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Universal Mother Lord! 52",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਜਗਤ ਦੇ ਮਾਤਾ ਸਰੂਪ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੫੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो लोक माता ॥५२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74424",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0070",
      "lineIndex": 70,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਭੇਖੀ ਅਭਰਮੀ ਅਭੋਗੀ ਅਭੁਗਤੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "abhekhee abharamee abhogee abhugate ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee Garbless Lord!  Salutation to Thee O Temptationless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਭੇਖਾ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ, ਭਰਮਾ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ, ਭੋਗਾ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ ਅਤੇ ਨਾ ਭੋਗੇ ਜਾ ਸਕਣ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अभेखी अभरमी अभोगी अभुगते ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74425",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0071",
      "lineIndex": 71,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਜੋਗ ਜੋਗੇਸ੍ਵਰੰ ਪਰਮ ਜੁਗਤੇ ॥੫੩॥",
      "transliteration": "namo jog jogesavaira(n) param jugate ||53||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Supreme Yogi Lord!  Salutation to Thee O Supremely-disciplined Lord! 53",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਜੋਗਾ ਦੇ ਵੀ ਜੋਗ ਅਤੇ ਸ੍ਰੇਸ਼ਠ ਜੁਗਤ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੫੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो जोग जोगेस्वरं परम जुगते ॥५३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74426",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0072",
      "lineIndex": 72,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਨਿੱਤ ਨਾਰਾਇਣੇ ਕ੍ਰੂਰ ਕਰਮੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo ni't naaraine kraoor karame ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Benign Protector Lord!  Salutation to Thee O Heinous-actions-Performer Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਜੀਵਾ ਦਾ ਕਲਿਆਣ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਅਤੇ ਭਿਆਨਕ ਕਰਮ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो नित्त नाराइणे क्रूर करमे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74427",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0073",
      "lineIndex": 73,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਪ੍ਰੇਤ ਅਪ੍ਰੇਤ ਦੇਵੇ ਸੁਧਰਮੇ ॥੫੪॥",
      "transliteration": "namo pret apret dheve sudharame ||54||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Virtuous-Sustainer Lord !  Salutation to Thee O Love-Incarnate Lord! 54",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪ੍ਰੇਤ-ਅਪ੍ਰੇਤ ਦਾ ਧਰਮ ਅਨੁਸਾਰ ਪਾਲਣ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ ਦੇਵ ਸਰੂਪ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੫੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो प्रेत अप्रेत देवे सुधरमे ॥५४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74428",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0074",
      "lineIndex": 74,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਰੋਗ ਹਰਤਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo rog harataa ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Ailments-remover Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਰੋਗ-ਨਾਸ਼ਕ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो रोग हरता ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74429",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0075",
      "lineIndex": 75,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਰਾਗ ਰੂਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo raag roope ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Love-Incarnate Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰੇਮ ਸਰੂਪ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो राग रूपे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74430",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0076",
      "lineIndex": 76,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਸਾਹ ਸਾਹੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo saeh saaha(n) ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Supreme Emperor Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸ਼ਾਹਾ ਦੇ ਸ਼ਾਹ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो साह साहं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74431",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0077",
      "lineIndex": 77,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਭੂਪ ਭੂਪੇ ॥੫੫॥",
      "transliteration": "namo bhoop bhoope ||55||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Supreme Sovereign Lord! 55",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਰਾਜਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਰਾਜੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੫੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो भूप भूपे ॥५५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74432",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0078",
      "lineIndex": 78,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਦਾਨ ਦਾਨੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo dhaan dhaane ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Greatest Donor Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਦਾਨੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਵੀ ਦਾਨੀ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो दान दाने ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74433",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0079",
      "lineIndex": 79,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਮਾਨ ਮਾਨੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo maan maane ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Greatest-Honours-Recipient Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਮਾਣਾ ਦੇ ਮਾਣ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो मान माने ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74434",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0080",
      "lineIndex": 80,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਰੋਗ ਰੋਗੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namo rog roge ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Ailments-Destroyer Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਰੋਗਾ ਦੇ ਰੋਗ (ਰੋਗ-ਨਾਸ਼ਕ)! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो रोग रोगे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74435",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0081",
      "lineIndex": 81,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਸਨਾਨੇ ॥੫੬॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) sanaane ||56||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Health-Restorer Lord! 56",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਇਸ਼ਨਾਨ ਸਰੂਪ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੫੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं सनाने ॥५६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74436",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0082",
      "lineIndex": 82,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮੋ ਮੰਤ੍ਰ ਮੰਤ੍ਰੰ ॥",
