      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Supreme Tantra Lord! 57",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਤੰਤ੍ਰਾ ਦੇ ਤੰਤ੍ਰ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੫੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमो तंत्र तंत्रं ॥५७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74440",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0086",
      "lineIndex": 86,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਦਾ ਸੱਚਦਾਨੰਦ ਸਰਬੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸੀ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sadhaa sa'chadhaana(n)dh saraba(n) pranaasee ||",
      "translation": "Thou art ever Lord Truth, Consciousness and Bliss",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਦਾ ਸੱਤ, ਚਿਤ, ਆਨੰਦ ਸਰੂਪ ਅਤੇ ਸਭ ਦਾ ਨਾਸ਼ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ!",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सदा सच्चदानंद सरबं प्रणासी ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74441",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0087",
      "lineIndex": 87,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਨੂਪੇ ਅਰੂਪੇ ਸਮਸਤੁਲ ਨਿਵਾਸੀ ॥੫੮॥",
      "transliteration": "anoope aroope samasatul nivaasee ||58||",
      "translation": "Unique, Formless, All-Pervading and All-Destoryer.58.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਉਪਮਾਰਹਿਤ, ਰੂਪ-ਰਹਿਤ ਅਤੇ ਸਭ ਵਿਚ ਨਿਵਾਸ ਕਰ ਰਹੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ) ॥੫੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अनूपे अरूपे समसतुल निवासी ॥५८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74442",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0088",
      "lineIndex": 88,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਦਾ ਸਿਧਦਾ ਬੁਧਦਾ ਬ੍ਰਿਧ ਕਰਤਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sadhaa sidhadhaa budhadhaa biradh karataa ||",
      "translation": "Thou art the Giver of riches and wisdom and Promoter.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਦਾ ਸਿੱਧੀ ਦੇਣ ਵਾਲੇ, ਬੁੱਧੀ ਦੇਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਅਤੇ ਵਾਧਾ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सदा सिधदा बुधदा बृध करता ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74443",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0003_line_0089",
      "lineIndex": 89,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਧੋ ਉਰਧ ਅਰਧੰ ਅਘੰ ਓਘ ਹਰਤਾ ॥੫੯॥",
      "transliteration": "adho uradh aradha(n) agha(n) ogh harataa ||59||",
      "translation": "Thou Pervadest netherworld, heaven and space and Destroyer of inumerable sins.59.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸਾਰੇ ('ਓਘ') ਉਤਮ, ਮਧਮ ਅਤੇ ਅਧਮ ਪਾਪਾ ('ਅਘੰ') ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲੇ! (ਤੈਨੂੰ) ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੫੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 3,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अधो उरध अरधं अघं ओघ हरता ॥५९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74444",
      "sourceShabadId": "7405",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    }
  ]
